WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.232
Install the .NET SDK: Install the dot net S D K from dotnet.microsoft.com slash download. Download the latest S D K — version 8 or newer. Run the installer, then finish.

2
00:00:15.082 --> 00:00:25.162
Verify with the terminal: Open Terminal or Command Prompt. Run dotnet dash dash version. A number like 8 point 0 means you are ready.

3
00:00:26.012 --> 00:00:36.764
Editor + C# tools: Install Cursor or Visual Studio Code. Add the C sharp Dev Kit extension. Open the csharp-beginner-workbook folder in the editor.

4
00:00:37.614 --> 00:00:49.806
Create and run a console app: Create a console app with dotnet new console. Move into the folder with cd. Run dotnet run, then edit Program.cs to make it yours.

5
00:00:50.656 --> 00:01:02.560
C# tips: Remember: C sharp is the language. Dot net is the toolbox. Open the whole project folder, finish Module 1, then take the quiz.
